<title>USA: US Freightways Corp stake cut by Vinik.</title>
<headline>US Freightways Corp stake cut by Vinik.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by former Fidelity Magellan Fund manager Jeffrey Vinik said Wednesday it sold it cut its stake in US Freightways Corp to 1,369,700 common shares or 5.3 percent from 7.3 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its stake reflected stock in the Rosemont, Ill., based company sold from February 10 to April 8 at prices ranging from $23.9712 to $27.0991 per share.</p>
